# fynns UI design system

This repo consumes `@fynns/ui` via **`@fynn7/ui-design-core`** (GitHub Packages)
with a Vite/tsconfig alias to
`node_modules/@fynn7/ui-design-core/src/index.ts`. It is the single source of
truth for UI. To install into a **new** consumer: follow `llm/CONSUME.md` and run
`scripts/install-as-npm.mjs` (`npm run consume:install`). Do **not** use a git
submodule for day-to-day consume. Short prompts still require reading
`llm/CONSUME.md` first (see `llm/opencode-fynns-ui-consume.md`).

**Public API purge / migration:** `llm/BREAKING_PURGE.md` — only symbols demoed in
sandbox Globals + Preview are public; do not import deleted APIs (Toast, Popover,
UnitStack, SearchInput, Panel*, BlockingLoadingOverlay, PanelSkeleton, …).
Dialog / Drawer / Textarea / Tabs / InlineAlert are restored; blocking /
sectional busy → BusyScrim / BusyRegion (+ runBusyTask / afterNextPaint so the
ring can paint before heavy work).

## Rules

- Build UI from `@fynns/ui` keep-set primitives (Button, IconButton, SplitButton,
  Input,
  Textarea, Select,
  Autocomplete, OtpInput, DropdownMenu (+ Group / Separator / CheckboxItem),
  ContextMenu (+ ContextMenuTrigger), Tooltip, InfoHint, Dialog / DialogShell /
  ConfirmDialog (M3 basic; dismissible labeled rows = Dialog + showCloseButton +
  full-width ControlStack + track-only Switch — not InfoHint demo as Preferences
  shell; see AGENTS.md), Drawer, FullscreenDialog,
  BottomSheet, Switch (dense only — no size/md), ToggleGroup, Tabs, Slider, Card (title/icon/actions + body;
  Collapsible shell, static head),
  Surface,
   LinearProgress/CircularProgress, BusyScrim/BusyRegion (`fill` = pane cold-start;
  `indicator="linear"` for known % — never nest a second progress in `message`;
  never EmptyState + ring),
  afterNextPaint/yieldToMain/runBusyTask/useBusyTask, BadgedBox, Avatar, AvatarGroup, Fab,
  FabMenu/FabMenuItem, TopAppBar (edge-flush — no radius / card frame; shell
  bottom hairline only), BottomAppBar, Toolbar, SearchBar, Banner,
  InlineAlert, snackbar/SnackbarHost, List/ListItem, Breadcrumb, Pagination
  (content-width nowrap strip; page-size Select stacks above as a Card-body
  sibling — never horizontal space-between), SkipLink, Stepper,
  EmptyState, Dropzone, Chat/ChatThread/ChatComposer/ChatScrollToBottom,
  ChatMessage (dual placement: main 48rem host, bubble 70%; EndAside /
  `.fynns-chat-host--fill` — bubble 100% of host to match composer shell on
  long turns, composer 100%; soft floor
  `--fynns-layout-chat-min-width`; `error`/`onRetry` = ChatGPT failed-
  generation footer under assistant turns; `actions` = Copy + Regenerate + More
  chrome (hover reveal; consumer wires LLM rerun — not core);
  `thinking` / `ChatThinking` =
  single-block reasoning / agent-activity disclosure between name and
  bubble (`streamingLabel` for tool status; label shimmer;
  collapsible while streaming unless user pinned closed);
  `ChatActivity` / `ChatActivityStep` / `ChatActivityArtifact` = Wave 2
  multi-step status tree (collapsible + rail; `icon` any ReactNode per step;
  consumer labels: **step active = progressive *-ing*** /
  **step done = past**; header may past-summarize while streaming —
  `Calling…` / `Ran the script`; AGENTS.md Label tense;
  stable `key` per logical step; step-row floor
  `--fynns-chatmessage-activity-step-min-height` then measured max across
  open steps — icon/label/artifact vertically centered; streaming min-busy
  hold on instant-done steps then complete one-shot on glyph + artifact;
  later steps stay queued until prior hold **and** complete, then fade as
  a whole — no translateY / no height morph / no clip-wipe); `citations` /
  `ChatCitations` / `ChatCitationChip` = browsing source chips under
  assistant body; body **element** siblings stack with
  `--fynns-chatmessage-body-stack-gap` (**16dp**, aliases `unit-stack-gap` —
  same as `.fynns-unit-stack`; core wraps bare string/number children as
  `.fynns-chat-message-prose` so `{text}<CodeBlock/>` gets the gap — do not
  patch in the consumer; streaming wraps last glyph in trailing prose); inline
  `code` = ChatGPT pill
  (`--fynns-color-chat-inline-code-bg`, radius-xs); prefer `ChatMessage markdown` /
  `ChatMarkdown` (L2 GFM subset); CJK IME Enter while
  composing does not send — AGENTS.md Composer keys; composer =
  growing `<textarea>` not ChatGPT ProseMirror — AGENTS.md Chat
  **composer input model** + `llm/CHAT_COMPOSER_LAYOUT.md` (multiline =
  bottom toolbar when expanded, compact single row when collapsed);
  reduced-motion
  stream-tail / scroll / shell — AGENTS.md Chat **Parity note
  (`prefers-reduced-motion`)**; user-edit parity:
  `llm/CHAT_USER_EDIT_UX.md`),
  Table (+ Head/Body/Row/HeaderCell/Cell/Caption; `.fynns-table-wrap` +
  nowrap / max-content → H-scroll when narrow), DiffView (unified-diff panel),
  CodeBlock
  (**strict:** titled `default` needs non-empty `label` or throws; no
  title → `variant="plain"`; see `llm/CONSUME.md` / `llm/BREAKING_PURGE.md`
  Behavioral breaking; zero-dep `--fynns-code-*` highlight for
  ts/js/py/cpp/css/json/xml/html/bash; **`label` ≠ `language`** — always pass
  matching `language` / profile (`llm/AGENT_INTERFACES.md`); fill editable →
  `autoGrow={false}`; consumer DSLs via `highlightProfile` /
  `registerHighlightLanguage`; unknown language stays plain),
  DatePicker/DatePickerDialog/DateRangePicker/DateRangePickerDialog,
  TimePicker/TimePickerDialog, Carousel/CarouselItem,
  NavigationRail, NavigationBar, NavigationDrawer (+ Headline / Group / Item;
  destination siblings use `--fynns-navdrawer-section-gap` — never
  `.fynns-unit-stack`; SearchBar/tools as a body sibling use
  `--fynns-navdrawer-search-gap` to destinations),
  DestinationAppShell, ClippedNavShell, EndAside,
  Divider, Checkbox, Radio, Chip (`assist`|`filter`|`input`|`suggestion` — not table-cell status),
  ControlStack/ControlRow/ControlBlock/FieldHint/FieldStack/Grid/FillColumn,
  FieldBlock/FieldHeader (optional description/errorText; label→control =
  `--fynns-layout-field-hint-gap` on FieldBlock `__main`),
  measureOverflow/useOverflowBounds, Collapsible).
  Reach for an existing keep-set primitive before writing a new control.
  See `AGENTS.md` catalog + `llm/BREAKING_PURGE.md` for removed → replacement.
  Destination chrome apps: **`DestinationAppShell`** (default) — or
  `ClippedNavShell` + `NavigationDrawer`/`NavigationRail` when fully custom;
  end inspector: `EndAside` (not modal `Drawer`, not revived Panel/ListGroup).
  Main canvas with Preview above Chat: **`FillColumn`** (`header` + `Chat` in
  children) so composer docks; never stack Preview/EmptyState/Composer as
  siblings. A catalog in that band = `.fynns-unit-stack` + `fynns-scroll`
  (default `Surface` is content-sized; only `fill` uses `min-height: 0`).
  **Platform:** see AGENTS.md **Platform targeting** — NavigationBar /
  BottomAppBar / BottomSheet / FullscreenDialog = mobile-first; NavigationRail =
  mobile-first densify only (never desktop greenfield root); Drawer /
  ContextMenu / Tooltip = desktop-first; DestinationAppShell / ClippedNavShell /
  EndAside / NavigationDrawer = adaptive; most controls = both. Layout templates
  demos are the composed default; Globals demos are standalone parts.
- Style with `--fynns-*` tokens only (e.g. `var(--fynns-color-accent)`,
  `var(--fynns-space-3)`, `var(--fynns-radius-md)`). Never hardcode hex/rgba.
  Vertical unit lists: Card / Collapsible body already use
  `--fynns-layout-unit-stack-gap`; outside those shells use `.fynns-unit-stack`
  (or sandbox `.sandbox-stack`). **Control + related note → `ControlBlock`**
  (`field-hint-gap`) — never a loose muted `<p>` under `ControlStack`. Single-row
  `description` docks in the **label column**; ToggleGroup centers on name+hint
  (not a full-bleed next row). Padded `Surface` is a form host. **Form
  options by semantic kind → `FieldStack`** (strongly recommended): plain
  FieldBlocks keep `field-stack-gap` (12dp); description/error (no choice
  cluster) opens the next sibling to `unit-stack-gap` (16dp); FieldBlocks
  with a `.fynns-control-cluster` open to `form-cluster-gap` (32dp);
  ControlBlocks to `unit-stack-gap` (16dp); adjacent stacks get
  `form-cluster-gap` **plus a horizontal `Divider`** on kind jumps. Do
  **not** flatten multi-topic forms as bare Card siblings — copy
  `#form-recipe` (`AGENTS.md` **FieldStack semantic clusters**). Form
  control → hint: `--fynns-layout-field-hint-gap` / `FieldHint`. Nested
  surface wells (`chrome="plain"` / `.fynns-nest`): `--fynns-layout-nest-gap`
  (plain ≠ flush). **Path / link / bookmark catalogs:** one `List` of
  `ListItem`s (headline + path + trailing ghost `sm` actions) — never a
  padded `Surface`/`Card` per entry (`AGENTS.md` **Content density**;
  sandbox `#list`). Expandable trees: `ListItem` **`detail`** in the same
  `<li>` (`ul > li` only); `overline` / `trailingSupportingText`; decorative
  leading chevron — never a button in `leading`, never `ul > div`. Long
  headline (optional `Tooltip`) ellipsizes in core — do not `tip-grow` /
  `max-content` the trigger. Trailing `IconButton` shares the row highlight.
  **Font families:** inherit `--fynns-font-ui` for body/chrome; `--fynns-font-mono`
  for code only; **never** `--fynns-font-serif` for main prose / forms / Chat /
  Dialog (serif = rare explicit editorial only — `AGENTS.md` **Font families**).
  Toolbar / labeled
  strips: prefer `ControlStack` + `ControlRow` and `--fynns-layout-control-*`
  (see AGENTS.md **Toolbar / unit rhythm**). Shell insets: content-inset
  (Collapsible / Drawer / Card / Fullscreen) vs nest-gap (plain nest hosts) vs
  dialog-inset (centered Dialog
  **and** Chat column outer via `--fynns-chat-thread-pad-inline`) vs
  strip-pad-inline (Banner / InlineAlert / Snackbar / ChatComposer collapsed
  text-only start + expanded text edge; shell = strip − glyph-inset — see
  `llm/CHAT_COMPOSER_LAYOUT.md`) vs capsule-chrome-pad-inline (SearchBar
  only — not ChatComposer; Composer uses `--fynns-chat-composer-pad-*`) vs
  field-pad-inline (Input / field-shell compose capsule + field-pad for
  Select text-start parity) /
  field-pad-block (Textarea — not Input sm zero block) — AGENTS.md
  **Inset decision tree**. **Never** invent rem/px/private inset vars for
  shell / column / chat margins — alias an existing `--fynns-layout-*` (or
  component token that already aliases one); consumers follow `llm/CONSUME.md`.
- Corner radius: only `var(--fynns-radius-*)`. Never add a private
  `--fynns-<component>-*-radius` (or any non-`radius` group radius alias).
  Every `RADIUS_TOKENS` key must show in the sandbox Globals shape inspector;
  new radius steps require a GUI row in the same change.
  **Chat containers** (bubble, citation cards, composer shell, new Chat*
  panels): never squarer than `--fynns-radius-22` unless the user
  **explicitly** asks; use `22` or rounder (`3xl` / `pill`). Micro marks
  (`code` / favicon) may stay smaller. See AGENTS.md Hard rules.
- **Consumers:** `@fynns/ui` is props-only — no local restyle wrappers or
  `.fynns-*` overrides. Missing capability → tell the user to land it in
  `fynns_ui_design_core` first (`llm/CONSUME.md`).
- **WYSIWYG / surface sync:** sandbox Globals/Preview resting look = consumer
  default. Keep `SANDBOX_DEFAULT_OVERRIDES` empty; promote aesthetics via
  `tokens.ts` + `npm run gen:theme`. **Never** remove a Globals demo while the
  symbol stays exported (or export without demo) — delete is **atomic**
  (unexport + TSX/CSS + demo/catalog/i18n + AGENTS + BREAKING_PURGE Removed
  row). `npm run check:wysiwyg` enforces this. Pasteable rule:
  `llm/consumer-cursor-rule.mdc`.
- **No consumer content in core/sandbox:** never paste consumer product strings,
  providers, routes, or domain jargon into Globals / Preview / defaults — generic
  placeholders only (AGENTS Hard rules + `.cursor/rules/no-consumer-content.mdc`).
- Do NOT reintroduce `@radix-ui/*` or `sonner`. Extend the self-developed
  primitives in the submodule instead. Do not resurrect purged Toast /
  Popover / Panel / BlockingLoadingOverlay / PanelSkeleton APIs. Transient
  feedback: `snackbar` + `SnackbarHost`. Blocking / sectional busy:
  `BusyScrim` / `BusyRegion`.
- App/teaching-specific tokens stay app-side under `--afs-*` (automata canvas)
  or `--dsa-*` (DSA bars/pointers/DSU). The global namespace is `--fynns-*`.
- If a token or component is missing, add it in the core package
  (`fynns_ui_design_core`) and run its `npm run gen:theme`, then **bump
  semver + publish GitHub Packages in the same task**
  (`docs/package-propagation.md`). Never deliver by aliasing a consumer at
  this checkout.
- Elevation ladder: `surface-1` → `surface-2` → `surface-3` → `surface-4` /
  `surface-5`. Light theme: `applyFynnsThemeMode("light")` /
  `restoreFynnsThemeMode()` from `@fynns/ui`.
- Nested containment (host → section → field): page / Dialog / Drawer may host
  `Card` sections (static `title` / optional `icon` / `actions`); title-less
  wells use `Surface`. Field-header trailing actions use
  `FieldHeader` / `FieldBlock` (`IconButton` + `Tooltip`). Overlay optional —
  agents choose the host. See AGENTS.md **Nested containment** /
  **Field header actions**.
- Skip `Tooltip` on self-evident dismiss/clear chrome (Dialog / Drawer /
  FullscreenDialog close X, Banner / Snackbar dismiss, Chip remove,
  SearchBar clear) — `aria-label` only. See AGENTS.md principle 3.
- **Performance:** for `ClippedNavShell` / `EndAside`, token inspectors,
  Globals-style catalogs, or live draft GUIs, read
  `packages/fynns_ui_design_core/llm/PERF.md` (or this repo’s `llm/PERF.md`)
  before coding — no observer↔probe loops, no tip forests, lazy-mount dense
  sections.

See `packages/fynns_ui_design_core/AGENTS.md` for the full token + component
catalog. Text in this package (docs / default labels) is English or German;
consumer sandboxes may offer English ↔ Chinese UI locale switching for their
own chrome.
